WEBVTT

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.930
M-My blade... It's so <i>tough</i>!

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:31.650
Dammit! What <i>are </i>those monsters?!

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.360
L-Lu Wuwei, sir...

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.870
Can Chu really be home to such beasts?

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:43.410
Not Chu--they come
from lands further south.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.830
"Elephants," I believe they're called.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:49.880
Don't we need to back down for now--
or send in reinforcements?

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:54.300
Lu Wuwei's and Gan Yang's
armies are in disarray!

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.050
No.

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.140
We need not do either.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:01.270
Those two won't be
shown up by mere beasts.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:05.480
Don't falter!

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.690
The enemy is ridiculously
huge, that's all.

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:09.900
They can't catch up to our horses!

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.490
Lu Wuwei, sir!

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:14.740
What is it?

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.910
The enemy is pulling up on our flank!

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:17.990
What?!

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.030
And from the right, too!

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.500
Beasts, moving like a unit of troops?

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.210
What, do they have a chain of command?

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:29.210
Huh?

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:36.550
He must be their captain.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:37.550
Give me that!

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:41.010
I need ten cavalrymen to grab
their shields and follow me!

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:42.010
Sir!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.480
"A Promotion in a Predicament"

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:23.910
There he is!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:27.540
That's the man in charge!
He is your sole target!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.410
Take him down in one hit!

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.420
Damn!

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.380
Caught in such a rudimentary trap...

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.800
General Lu Wuwei!

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:01.490
"Teng Army, Qin" "Gang Yang"

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:01.490
Never mind the beasts--
kill every last enemy soldier up top!

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.700
All archers, loose a barrage of arrows!

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.210
They withdrew?

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.420
They're leaving!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.000
We drove those monsters away!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.260
"Teng"

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:25.180
It appears that Lu Wuwei's and Gan Yang's
army have driven off the enemy.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:28.180
The Chu army's flamboyant
move really backfired!

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:30.810
This rout will have boosted our morale!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.310
No--that was too easy.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:41.030
War is all about charming
people, is it not?

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.860
In that sense,

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.200
the war elephants did a fine job.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:51.540
The enemy's giddy, in high spirits
over the beasts' sheer rarity.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:57.290
But on the battlefield,
that's a terribly frightening thing.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.670
Something's... not right.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:05.300
Enemies? Were there always enemies there?

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:08.680
Because the truly dreadful foe...

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:11.600
No--they weren't there before.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.560
...will frolic <i>with </i>you,

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:20.110
slipping their hands around
your neck before you know it.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.940
"Qin"

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.940
Wh-What <i>is </i>that army?

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.530
Where'd they come from?

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.240
In other words,

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:31.330
once the first grand spectacle
has faded into the wind,

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:35.830
the board appears before you--
and you're nearly in checkmate.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.170
What?!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:42.250
Tch.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:47.380
H-How can that be?
Then that unit of giant beasts...

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.010
Right.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.930
That was nothing but a distraction.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:57.020
Now we can attack as much
as we like from any direction.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:06:00.810
Better watch yourself,
General Teng of Qin.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:04.740
As of this moment, one false move

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:08.200
and you won't live to see the noonday sun.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:21.000
Charge! Take down the Qin general Teng!

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.340
Here they come!

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:26.670
Enemy troops approaching
from the front left--

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.680
three to four thousand of them!

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.680
Sir!

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.050
General Teng?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.180
Long Guo, you're the center army.
Form two flanks!

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:40.730
We'll surround the main camp
and hide our reinforcements there!

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:42.400
"Long Guo Army"

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:42.400
All right! Come on!

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.610
This was a tight defensive formation

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:53.330
that paid attention to each direction
while still being surrounded.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:58.960
But this deployment was also
lacking in one major aspect.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:02.040
T-Teng, sir, a moment?

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:07.710
With this setup, there'll be no army
to give aid to Lu Wuwei or Gan Yang!

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:11.050
Both of their armies are
surrounded by the enemy!

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:16.930
No reinforcements. We're outnumbered--
we can't save everyone.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:19.310
Right now we must keep
the main camp from destruction,

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:21.480
even if we leave both
armies to their deaths.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:26.190
The enemy shows no signs of sending
reinforcements to the front!

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:29.530
Huh! Cutting those two
armies loose, are you?

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:35.280
Not bad for a first move,
General Teng of Qin.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:41.920
I won't hold back, then--we'll go
right ahead and crush them flat.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:45.210
Begin the siege on
the enemy army in front!

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.210
Sir!

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.920
Now for the main event.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:53.340
How long can you hold out
against my unrelenting onslaught

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:56.220
from every direction?

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:58.680
The enemy is closing in!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:03.940
They're coming!
Spread out the right flank!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:06.320
We're still too weak.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:10.070
We're changing the commanders
of the left and right flanks!

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:13.280
Changing... their commanders?

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.530
But to whom?

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.660
The 5,000 troops on the left flank

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:19.790
will be led by Wang Ben
of the Yu Feng Force!

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.670
And those on the right flank

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:26.880
go to Meng Tian of the Le Hua Force!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.050
I hereby appoint you both!

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.510
--I accept!
--I accept!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.090
Wait, what?!

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:36.350
I-I know both units have
performed well--but still!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:39.720
Aren't they too young
to take the lead here?

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.180
Age doesn't matter.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.520
"Center: Long Guo Army"
"Left Flank: Wang Ben Army"
"Right Flank: Meng Tian Army"
"Main Camp"

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:49.440
The cavalry has completed
its preparations!

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.570
Lu Xian.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:56.870
It's a big promotion,
but in the middle of all this?

00:08:56.870 --> 00:09:00.370
Maybe you accepted a little too readily.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:03.660
No, not at all.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.750
Objectively speaking, Wang Ben and I
are the only ones in Teng's army

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.000
who can fight in these conditions.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.090
Pops?

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:19.220
You're in charge here.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:21.640
If you get into any trouble, raise a flag.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.430
Sir... yes, sir!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:27.270
I shall defend this unit with my life!

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:31.440
Don't be reckless, now. You can't die
till you've held my child, remember?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.070
Follow the strategy!

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:40.910
We in the cavalry hold fate itself
in our hands--don't forget that!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.040
Let's go!

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:51.500
Meng Tian... you've gotten so big!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:57.220
And you're bound to get even bigger.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:01.010
"Le"

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:01.010
O ye heavens... keep him safe, I pray.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:07.440
The cavalry is on the move!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.730
Are they after us?

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:14.610
Our formation is still surrounded
by the enemy. Do <i>not </i>stop moving!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:18.160
Stop and we'll be
caught up in their blades.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:22.660
That's why we absolutely
must avoid a head-on clash!

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:24.080
Wh-What the--

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.750
They dodged!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.000
What we're looking to attack...

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.750
...is the enemy's backs!

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:35.880
Onward!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:42.220
The right-flank cavalry has broken
in behind the attacking foe!

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.180
Same here!

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:48.440
The cavalry on the left flank
has charged the enemy's rear!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:54.400
Okay, that'll do! Now pull away!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:02.660
Getting hit from behind is enough
to tank enemy morale!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.830
Five slashes is plenty! Let's go!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:10.080
The right-flank cavalry is withdrawing
from the enemy's rear!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.080
So is the cavalry on the left flank!

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:15.210
Surely they could have done more!

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:20.840
Meng Tian, sir!
There's a safe area over there!

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:24.510
No good! We wouldn't have anywhere
to go after the second charge!

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:27.930
Surprised, Gao Mu?

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:33.610
Meng Tian's always thinking
three or four steps ahead!

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:39.240
He memorizes all the enemies' locations as
he rides, so the cavalry can keep moving.

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:40.240
And then...

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:45.530
...we strike from behind a second time,
where their ranks are weakened.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:49.870
Th-The enemy is faltering!

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.870
All thanks to that cavalry!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:54.330
Now! Repel the enemy!

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.210
All right. We can do this.

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.630
If the cavalry keeps moving
and hitting from behind,

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:04.180
our infantry can catch their breath.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:09.020
And if they <i>keep </i>breathing,
this camp won't break so easily!

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.310
Pull away!

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:20.820
Hei Jin's grumbling about
not doing enough fighting!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.320
Utter foolishness.
This will be a long, drawn-out battle.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.740
The loss of even one rider
is not to be taken lightly.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:30.580
The cavalry is the very
lifeline of this fight!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:33.620
What <i>are </i>the cavalries doing?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.920
They're both making the same moves!

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:38.710
But those two never had
a chance to discuss this!

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:43.840
No, the two had not
arranged this in advance.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.640
Yet with the appearance of
these two young commanders,

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:51.310
this battle began drifting toward becoming
an unthinkably tight match.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:55.020
And I'm the one who chose them.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:06.280
"Hangu Pass"

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:06.280
Captain! The enemy's added even
more archers to their ranks!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.240
There are far more than
there were yesterday!

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:09.910
We're taking serious damage!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.790
Don't panic! We have plenty
of troops in reserve!

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.370
Besides, their ladders
still only reach halfway.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.500
Hangu Pass can't be conquered
with bow and arrow!

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.500
"Wei"

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.720
"Commanding General of Wei"
"Wu Fengming"

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.720
Let's bring them out, shall we?

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.720
Sir!

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:30.760
Hmm?

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.150
Wh-What massive crossbows!

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:39.860
And so many of them!

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:41.940
A ballista brigade.

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:47.280
I'd heard they were too difficult
to make, unusable in combat.

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:53.000
The Wei army brings out
nonstandard equipment yet again.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.870
We're within range! All units, halt!

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.420
Prepare to fire!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.920
Ready!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.140
No! They're gonna fire on us!

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:09.930
Those arrows are <i>huge</i>!

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:14.100
That's just a bluff!
Giant arrows are still just arrows!

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.940
No--they're more than that.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:18.100
Boss...

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.770
Let's watch and see.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.900
Fengming, sir?

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.150
Begin.

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:25.400
Fire!

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:29.530
Here they come!

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.670
Huh? There's... no damage?

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:46.590
And look!
No casualties all around us, either!

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:48.880
They <i>missed</i>!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:52.300
But what was all that shaking about?

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:54.100
Whoa! They stuck right in!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.060
Wh-What force!

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:58.190
But so what? They missed!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:00.940
Huh?

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.610
There's rope on these bolts!

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:07.030
All right! Now we climb!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.450
Spread out the ropes
so more of us can climb!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.740
Go!

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:15.290
This is an emergency! The enemy is
climbing the ropes attached to the bolts!

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.450
They're <i>what</i>?!

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:22.670
Those ballistas had to be big enough
to drive stakes into Hangu Pass.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:27.380
He's a formidable man,
this General Wu Fengming of Wei.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:30.930
Show Wu Yi Hu, too!
Show Wu Yi Hu what's going on!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.850
Watch out, Chief!

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:37.140
Drop rocks on them!

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.520
Get those bolts out of there!

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:41.850
It's looking pretty bad, boss!

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:46.690
So much for "Hangu Pass--not even once."

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:51.530
And both times with proper bridges, too.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.450
I-It's not really funny, boss...

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:59.660
Giant siege towers, giant ballistas...

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:03.460
So many different types
of genius in the world today.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.290
Maybe I'll bring him back to Chu.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.670
You jest.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:09.800
Still...

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.260
If those ballistas can keep
firing again and again,

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:15.100
we can keep on adding
bridges indefinitely.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:19.430
That's the worst possible means
of attack for the defending side.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:24.560
This must have been Fengming's killer
move, kept in reserve just for today.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.530
He's throwing that into the mix, too?

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:34.450
Fengming, sir!
The seige tower has arrived!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.870
Where shall we put it?

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.120
Where else?

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.710
Dammit! It's in a blind spot--I can't see!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:42.620
Hmm?

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:43.670
Here they come!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.080
Archers, fall back!

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:49.170
Zhang Tang's army is
losing ground already...

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.670
Of course they're fast.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:54.220
The "roaring spheres" I formulated

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:58.510
cause death by hemorrhage
in about eight days.

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:01.310
And today is day eight...

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:07.270
...when a veil of death will be falling
upon Zhang Tang's main camp.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:08.570
Zhang Teng, sir!

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.780
Stay away from me!

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:12.440
It might be contagious!

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:13.450
General!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.700
Damn you, Han army.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:21.160
Forcing that poison on us--
so it would come into play today!

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:24.920
Sir, you can't possibly lead
in your condition!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.790
And with this battle situation...

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:30.880
Shouldn't we request assistance
from Meng Ao on the left?

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.460
No!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.800
Old Bai Lao has enemies
climbing toward him as we speak.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.850
We can't add to his burden!

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:43.230
Then... we'll ask Huan Yi on the right!

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:44.600
Don't!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:47.730
Do not depend on a man like that!

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:50.650
"Eight Days Earlier"

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.950
Where's old Bai Lao?

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.910
It's just me.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:02.790
Tch.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:06.960
You've got a lot of nerve
duping me like that, old man.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:09.790
I'm leaving.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.170
Wait, bandit!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:14.170
Say what?

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:20.140
Do you have the resolve
to defend this nation?

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:27.600
I'm asking if you have the
determination to become a general

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:30.060
who carries this nation on his shoulders.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:33.900
You rotten old fart...

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:45.660
Of <i>course </i>I don't. What are you, senile?

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:47.160
What?

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:50.580
The resolve to defend this nation?

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.090
Now <i>that's </i>a laugh.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:57.170
Qin could fall tomorrow--
it makes no nevermind to me.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:19:00.260
Then why are you here?

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:03.310
Well, let's see. To put it simply...

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:06.230
Because I'm <i>really good </i>at war.

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:11.560
Way better than those fools who act all
uppity just because they're generals.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:12.690
Wait!

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:21.820
So do <i>you </i>have the resolve
to throw it all away for Qin?

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:23.620
A ridiculous question.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:31.500
Okay, well, when your troops are up
against a wall, come groveling to me.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:36.380
Beat your head against the ground
and beg and I'll help you out.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.050
Small price to pay, right?

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.720
How dare you!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.260
Later.

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:47.890
But it <i>will </i>happen.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:54.820
A successful defense hangs
entirely on my quick wits.

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:59.900
We don't <i>need </i>any help!

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:03.320
I'll take command. We'll respond by--

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:06.410
Zhang Tang, sir, it's no use!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:09.870
A siege tower!
Wei's siege tower, headed this way!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:12.210
Dammit! It's coming right to us!

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:19.380
All right, now's our chance!

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:20.380
Hup!

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:26.050
Now <i>go</i>!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:29.220
The center's about to give way.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:32.350
That'll be in the hands
of the Wei army now!

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:37.610
If one goes down, the camps on
both sides will follow. Which means...

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.650
...the fall of Hangu Pass.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.700
No! Drive them back!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.950
Forward! Get them under control!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:49.700
The cavalry!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:51.460
How'd they wind up <i>here</i>?!

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:54.120
The cavalry?!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:57.590
General Huan Yi!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:02.590
I knew this would happen, Zhang Tang.

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:10.680
Why are <i>you </i>here?
No one asked for your help!

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:14.560
Quit playing around, old man.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.600
What?

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.400
This ain't the time.

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:25.860
The tide turned in their favor once
those giant crossbows showed up.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:27.530
If we don't want to be pulled under,

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:30.870
we need to do something
big, too--and fast.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:33.080
Something big?

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:34.790
Oh!

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:39.130
Huan Yi's army is rapidly
losing ground to the enemy!

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:41.170
Well, what are you gonna do?

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:45.720
I brought all our strongest
muscle over here with me.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:48.430
Huan Yi... you came... for me?

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:52.470
Oh, please. Don't take this
the wrong way, old man.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:57.690
I'm just here because something
juicy's rolled up in front of you.

00:21:57.690 --> 00:21:59.730
The siege tower?

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:03.150
Considering what I've sliced off
to use as bait,

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.780
we ought to be able to
hook one gigantic fish.

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:07.320
Go!

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:13.910
Fire them arrows!

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:21.340
Chuck them smoke bombs! Plop!

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:24.130
What the--

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:25.510
--Huh?!
--Smoke?

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:26.510
Smoke!

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:28.340
Run!

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:30.050
--Hurry!
--Quit pushing!

00:22:30.050 --> 00:22:32.180
Retreat! Retreat!

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:35.180
It's been set on fire again!

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:39.100
That can't be!
The wood's been well soaked in water!

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:40.360
What's the meaning of this?!

00:22:46.650 --> 00:22:48.860
Hey! What are you doing out here?!

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:51.490
There's a fire! They set it on fire again!

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:55.000
No, they didn't--it's the ground
behind us that's burning!

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:57.210
But it's nothing but smoke in there!

00:22:58.460 --> 00:22:59.460
Huh?

00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:21.100
Now, then... let's get this started.

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:58.370
Next time on <i>Kingdom</i>: "A General's Pride."
